Description: Simultaneous inference for high-dimensional linear models based
    on the de-biased (de-sparsified) lasso and the bootstrap: the procedures of
    Zhang and Cheng (2017) <doi:10.1080/01621459.2016.1166114> for
    simultaneous confidence intervals, support recovery, testing for sparse
    signals and stepdown multiple testing; and the bootstrapped de-sparsified
    lasso of Dezeure, Buehlmann and Zhang (2017)
    <doi:10.1007/s11749-017-0554-2> with residual, wild and xyz-paired
    bootstrap, Westfall-Young multiple testing, simultaneous confidence
    intervals and group tests. Includes lasso.proj() and boot.lasso.proj(),
    which reproduce the corresponding functions of the archived 'hdi' package,
    and a scaled lasso following Sun and Zhang (2012)
    <doi:10.1093/biomet/ass043>.
